   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "After the join the token is never used again: the kubelet talks to the API server with its own certificate, and renews it by itself.\nThe hash protects the worker from a fake cluster; the token protects the cluster from unknown machines.",
   "originalText": "After the join the token is never used again: the kubelet talks to the API server with its own certificate, and renews it by itself.\nThe hash protects the worker from a fake cluster; the token protects the cluster from unknown machines.",
